    {
      "path": "src/ui/screens/ReviewSettlement.tsx",
      "content": "Disable the sale and expiration choices while `saving` is true, not just the record-later button. With a slow Settle Later save, the user can open the sale form or “It expired worthless” and start entering values before it resolves. The eventual `onSaved` advances/collapses the card; `ReviewView.saved` deliberately excludes `action:${tradeId}` from its draft-preservation check, which is also the ID used by these new forms, so that draft is discarded without a warning. Apply the saving guard to all alternative workflow buttons (including the worthless/record-expiration buttons).",
